<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="home.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Josefin+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <title>DineFlow - Smart Restaurant System</title>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <nav>
            <img src="logo.png" alt="DineFlow logo">
            <a href="/home">Home</a>
            <a href="/menu">Menu</a>
            <a href="/offers">Offers</a>
            <a href="/reviews">Reviews</a>
            <a href="/about">About</a>
            <a href="/login">Staff</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <p class="eyebrow">Table ordering made calmer</p>
                <h1>Serve faster without losing the restaurant feel.</h1>
                <p>DineFlow connects guests, kitchen teams, and payment counters with a simple digital flow built for busy restaurants.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="primary-action" href="/menu">Open Menu</a>
                    <a class="secondary-action" href="/">Register Table</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-panel">
                <div class="live-strip">
                    <span class="pulse"></span>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Live service board</strong>
                        <span>Table orders update in one place</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="order-board">
                    <div class="ticket">
                        <strong>Table <span class="table-number">2</span></strong>
                        <div>
                            <strong><span class="quantity-number">2x</span> Paneer Butter Masala</strong>
                            <small>With butter naan and cold coffee</small>
                        </div>
                        <span class="badge">Cooking</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ticket">
                        <strong>Table <span class="table-number">4</span></strong>
                        <div>
                            <strong><span class="quantity-number">1x</span> Masala Dosa</strong>
                            <small>Ready for pickup</small>
                        </div>
                        <span class="badge">Ready</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ticket">
                        <strong>Table <span class="table-number">5</span></strong>
                        <div>
                            <strong><span class="quantity-number">3x</span> Veg Biryani</strong>
                            <small>New order received</small>
                        </div>
                        <span class="badge">New</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="stats">
            <div class="stat">
                <strong class="stat-number">5</strong>
                <span>Active Tables</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
                <strong class="stat-number">4</strong>
                <span>Menu Items</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
                <strong class="stat-number">3</strong>
                <span>Staff Views</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat">
                <strong class="stat-number">1</strong>
                <span>Smoother Flow</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="flow">
            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>A dining loop that is easy to follow.</h2>
                <p>Guests register a table, browse the menu, add items, place the order, and the team can track it from kitchen to payment.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flow-grid">
                <div class="flow-card">
                    <span class="step-number">01</span>
                    <h3>Register Table</h3>
                    <p>Guests enter their details and choose an available table.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flow-card">
                    <span class="step-number">02</span>
                    <h3>Browse Menu</h3>
                    <p>Clear dish cards make ordering quick from any browser.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flow-card">
                    <span class="step-number">03</span>
                    <h3>Send Order</h3>
                    <p>Kitchen receives table-wise items and quantities.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flow-card">
                    <span class="step-number">04</span>
                    <h3>Close Table</h3>
                    <p>Payment staff can reset table status after billing.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div>&copy; 2025 DineFlow. All Rights Reserved.</div>
        <div>Created by- Parth Gupta</div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
